//! Full pure-plan differential test for `submitLiveFactoryAiDecision`.
//!
//! The checked-in corpus is generated by invoking the canonical TypeScript
//! driver at `src/engine/factoryAiLiveDriver.ts:468-572` with a terminal,
//! deterministic reducer, then removing only its generic transition.  This
//! test reconstructs the source's JSON receipt shape from the native plan so
//! the switch policy, history sync, live view, action gate, and move trace
//! remain one indivisible parity contract.
//!
//! Regenerate with `node --experimental-strip-types
//! core-rs/tools/gen-factory-ai-live-planner-vectors.mjs`.

